From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fixture Developer <dev@mobimanual.local>
Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 16:20:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Let administrators upload a company logo

Settings gets a Branding section. A logo uploaded there replaces the
MobiVisor logo in the top bar of the console and on the sign-in page.
PNG and SVG files up to 1 MB are accepted. Remove logo brings back the
MobiVisor logo.
---
Expected: worth documenting. Triage answers doc-impact. New functionality that fits an existing page: the draft adds a Branding section to _settings.md with the upload, the accepted files and Remove logo. A mention under "Signing in" on chapter1.md is fine as well.
Expected-outcome: opened
Expected-edits: _settings.md
Expected-may-edit: chapter1.md

